 ],
 "notes": "The log group name is built in a module local in the GT (unknown at plan, locals invisible), so the \"logs\" base name and the pet-suffix wiring cannot be observed; only random_pet existence is checked. scoped_to_group reads the declared policy text: it requires a reference to the log group and no quoted lone \"*\" (a wildcard Resource) anywhere in the policy, or, for an aws_iam_policy_document, no \"*\" resource. A second, separate policy granting \"*\" is not detected."
